{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1025860,\"title\":\"Nevěsta pro Paddyho\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A balladic fairy tale about the underground kingdom of goblins, based on Irish fairy tales. When darkness and rainy clouds gathering low in the sky increase, when October turns into November, everyone in Ireland celebrates Halloween. The eve of All Saints' Day is a time when children run around outside in picturesque masks, adults raise their mugs by the light of flickering torches in hollowed-out turnips, and the world of goblins comes to life underground. It is the only day when these creatures, no bigger than a grown mouse, can enter the human world, and also when mortals can enter their realm. And so Paddy, a young innkeeper generally considered a fool and a child, finds himself in the Moss Hall through a magical well and, in his kindness and desire for love, breaks the laws of the underworld.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":1999,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CZ\",\"name\":\"Czech Republic\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jitka Němcová\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1717946,\"name\":\"Jitka Němcová\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":133561,\"name\":\"Radek Holub\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s8bJAr5rG9D3ogGYE7gYKvCQNVz.jpg\"},{\"id\":2001265,\"name\":\"Michaela Frkalová\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/84sGPohsGwdFQQOwytuOJJvu98i.jpg\"},{\"id\":72793,\"name\":\"Marián Labuda\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7CDDUGjWxLLnG7TCT6uY0Bycs7U.jpg\"},{\"id\":140440,\"name\":\"Jiří Schmitzer\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/15y87lk2BuWx4FyK2ZInq0BXXvC.jpg\"},{\"id\":544500,\"name\":\"Bára Štěpánová\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"ph